    "hadeeth": "An rawaito daga Abu Huraira -Allah ya yarda da shi- ya ce: \"Manzon Allah SAW ya Kasance yana E'itikafi a cikin goman kowane Azumin Ramadan, to yayin da shekarar da aka karbi ransa ta zo yayi E'itikafi kwana Ashirin\"",
