    "hadeeth": "An rawaito daga Abdullahi Bn Abbas -Allah ya yarda da su- ya ce: \"Ukkaz da Mijna da Thul-Majaz a lokacin Jahil;iyya Kasuwanni ne sai kuke ganin laifi ne kuyi kasuwanci a cikinsu lokacin aikin Hajji, Sai Allah ya saukar da: Babu laifi akan ku ku nemi Falala daga Ubangijinku\" Bakara:198 a cikin lokacin Hajji\"",
