          "An ambaci Hajji Jihadi; domin cewa shi jihadi ne na rai, kuma a cikinsa akwai bada dukiya, da ƙarfin jiki, shi ibada ce ta jiki da dukiya kamar yaƙi a tafarkin Allah.",
