    "category": "FIƘHU DA USULU",
    "title": "Sulaiman Xan Dauda -Amincin Allah a gare shi ya ce: \"Na rantse a wannan Daren zan taki Matana guda Saba'in kowace mace daga cikin su zata haifi Yaron da zaiyi jahadi a Tafarkin Allah",
    "hadeeth": "Daga Abu huraira -Allah ya yarda da shi daga Manzon Allah SAW ya ce: \"Sulaiman Xan Dauda -Amincin Allah a gare shi ya ce: \"Na rantse a wannan Daren zan taki Matana guda Saba'in kowace mace daga cikin su zata haifi Yaron da zaiyi jahadi a Tafarkin Allah",
