    "category": "ILIMIN AƘIDA",
    "title": "ya wuce, kuma babu wani abu a gidana da wani mai hanta zai iya ci sai guntun sha’ir a cikin rake domin ni.",
    "hadeeth": "A kan hadisin A’isha, Allah Ya yarda da ita, ta ce: Manzon Allah - tsira da amincin Allah su tabbata a gare shi - ya wuce, kuma babu wani abu a gidana da wani mai hanta zai iya ci sai guntun sha’ir a cikin rake domin ni.",
