  4929: {
    "category_id": 3,
    "category": "ILIMIN AƘIDA",
    "title": "Tsakanin ffsan fuka fukai arba'in, suka ce: Ya Abu Huraira kwana arba'in? Ya ce: Shin kun ƙi? Sai suka ce: Shekara arba'in? Ya ce: Na ki. Suka ce: Watan arba'in? Ya ce: Na ki",
    "hadeeth": "Daga Abu Hurairah, yardar Allah ta tabbata a gare shi, wanda ya ce: Manzon Allah - tsira da amincin Allah su tabbata a gare shi - ya ce: “Tsakanin masu faxi guda biyu akwai arba’in.” Suka ce: Ya Abu Huraira kwana arba’in? Ya ce: Na ki. Suka ce: shekara arba'in? Ya ce: Na ki. Suka ce: Watan arba'in? Ya ce: Na ki. \"Kuma duk abin da mutum yake sawa daga mutum in banda guntun jela, wanda aka sanya halitta a cikinsa, sa'annan Allah yana saukar da ruwa daga sama, kuma suna girma kamar yadda umesan itacen ke tsiro.\"",
    "explanation": "",
    "hints": [
        ],
    "grade": "Ingantacce ne",
    "attribution": "Bukhari da Muslim suka Rawaito shi",
  },
  4931: {
