  },
  5463: {
    "category_id": 5,
    "category": "FALALOLI DA LADUBBA",
    "title": "Za a shigar da Jahannama a wannan rana a kansa saboda iyayengiji dubu saba'in, tare da kowace sarauta ta sarakuna dubu saba'in da suke jan ta",
    "hadeeth": "Daga Abdullah bn Masoud - Allah ya yarda da shi - tare da rahoto: \"Za a shigar da Jahannama a wannan rana a kansa saboda iyayengiji dubu saba'in, tare da kowace sarauta ta sarakuna dubu saba'in da suke jan ta.\"",
    "explanation": "Ranar tashin kiyama za'a kawo mata wuta da igiya dubu saba'in, wanda zata jagoranta, kuma a kowace igiya sarakuna dubu saba'in zasu mata jagora da ita.",
