    "attribution": "Muslim ne ya rawaito shi",
  },
  5469: {
    "category_id": 5,
    "category": "FALALOLI DA LADUBBA",
    "title": "Ya Allah, ka warkar da farin ciki, ya Allah, ka warkar da farin ciki, ya Allah, ka warkar da Sa'adi",
    "hadeeth": "Daga Saad bin Abi Waqas - yardar Allah ta tabbata a gare shi - ya ce: Manzon Allah - SAW- ya tursasa ni ya ce: \"Ya Allah, ka warkar da farin ciki, ya Allah, ka warkar da farin ciki, ya Allah, ka warkar da Sa'adi\".",
    "explanation": "",
    "hints": [
