    "category": "FALALOLI DA LADUBBA",
    "title": "\"Duk wanda aka bashi Raihan, to kada yaki karba, saboda yana saukin dauka, ga kuma dadin Kamshi\"",
    "hadeeth": "An rawaito daga Abu huraira -Allah ya yarda da shi -daga Annabi: \"Duk wanda aka bashi Raihan, to kada yaki karba, saboda yana saukin dauka, ga kuma dadin Kamshi\"",
    "explanation": "Duk wanda aka bashi turare ko aka nemi a sanya masa to ya dace ya karba, saboda babu wata wahala a cikin dauka kuma kanshinsa mai dadi ne",
