    "category": "ILIMIN AƘIDA",
    "title": "Lallai ne ku bada zuwa Ma'abotansa Ranar Al-kiyama har sai anyi sakamako ga Akuya Mai kaho da Mara Kaho",
    "hadeeth": "An awai to daga Abu Huraira -Allah ya yada da shi- daga Annabi: \"Lallai ne ku bada zuwa Ma'abotansa Ranar Al-kiyama har sai anyi sakamako ga Akuya Mai kaho da Mara Kaho\"",
    "explanation": "\"Wanda aka zalunta za'a daukar masa Fansa daga wanda ya zalunce shi Ranar Al-kiyama har Akuya wacce batada kaho za'a dauka Mata fansa daga Mai kaho kuma Ubangijin ka baya Zaluntar wani daya\"",
