  },
  5828: {
    "category_id": 4,
    "category": "FIƘHU DA USULU",
    "title": "\"Dayanku yayi Sallah cikin Nishadi, Idan kuma ya gaji to yayi kwanciyarsa\"",
    "hadeeth": "An rawaito daga Anas -Allah ya yarda da shi- ya ce Annabi -Amincin Allah a gare shi ya shiga Masallaci sai ga wata igiya an daurata a jikin durkoki biyu, sai ya ce : \"Wannan Igiyar maye?\" sai suka ce wannan Igiyara ta Zainab ce, idan ta gaji sai ta rike ta, sai Annabi -Amincin Allah a gare shi ya ce: \"ku kwance ta,Dayanku yayi Sallah cikin Nishadi, Idan kuma ya gaji to yayi kwanciyarsa\"",
