  },
  5855: {
    "category_id": 4,
    "category": "FIƘHU DA USULU",
    "title": "\"Lallai cewa matata ta haifi Bakin Yaro, sai Annabi ya ce Kana da Rakuma? sai ya ce E, sai ya ce yaya launukansu yake? sai yace: jajaye sai yace shin cikinta akwai wadanda yasha banban da su? ya ce: E lallai cikinsu akwai wadanda suka sha baban, ya ce: to ta yaya aka samu hakan? ya ce: To watakila ya gado jini ne, yace wannan ma watakila ya ya gado jini ne\"",
    "hadeeth": "An rawaito daga Abu Huraira -Allah ya yarda da shi- cewa wani balaraben kauye yazo sai ya ce: ya Manzon Allah, \"Lallai cewa matata ta haifi Bakin Yaro, sai Annabi ya ce Kana da Rakuma? sai ya ce E, sai ya ce yaya launukansu yake? sai yace: jajaye sai yace shin cikinta akwai wadanda yasha banban da su? ya ce: E lallai cikinsu akwai wadanda suka sha baban, ya ce: to ta yaya aka samu hakan? ya ce: To watakila ya gado jini ne, yace wannan ma watakila ya ya gado jini ne\"",
    "explanation": "",
