    "title": "\"Na Umarce ku da yin tafiya cikin duhun dare, Saboda Kasa ana Nade ta da daddare\"",
    "hadeeth": "An rawaito daga Anas -Allah ya yarda da shi- zuwa ga Annabi: \"Haddin Dan Dabo Sare wuya\"",
