    "category": "FALALOLI DA LADUBBA",
    "title": "\"Manzon Allah ya Kasance, yana jinkirtawa a bayan Matafiya, Saboda ya taimakawa Rarrauna, Kuma ya dauke shi kuma yayi Masa Addu'a\"",
    "hadeeth": "An rawaito daga Jabir Bn Abdullah -Allah ya yarda da su- \"Manzon Allah ya Kasance, yana jinkirtawa a bayan Matafiya, Saboda ya taimakawa Rarrauna, Kuma ya dauke shi kuma yayi Masa Addu'a\"",
