  6042: {
    "category_id": 4,
    "category": "FIƘHU DA USULU",
    "title": "\"Cewa Manzon Allah yayi sauki cikin cinikin Al-araya, cikin Buhu biyar ko kasa da buhu biyar\"",
    "hadeeth": "An rawaito daga Abu Huraira: Allah ya yarda da shi: \"Cewa Manzon Allah yayi sauki cikin cinikin Al-araya, cikin Buhu biyar ko kasa da buhu biyar\"",
    "explanation": "",
