  },
  6185: {
    "category_id": 4,
    "category": "FIƘHU DA USULU",
    "title": "Manzon Allah ya kasance yana bude baki da danyan dabino kafin yayi salla\"",
    "hadeeth": "An rawaito daga Anas Bn Malik -Allah ya yarda da shi-ya ce:Manzon Allah ya kasance yana bude baki da danyan dabino kafin yayi salla, idan babu danyan dabino sai yayi da bushasshen Dabino, idan babu sai ya kurbi wani abu daga Ruwa\"",
    "explanation": "",
