    "category": "SIRA DA TARIHI",
    "title": "\"Allah bai aiki wani Annabi ba sai yayi kiwon Dabbobi",
    "hadeeth": "\"Allah bai aiki wani Annabi ba sai yayi kiwon Dabbobi, sai Sahabbansa suka ce: kai fa? yace \"E, nakasance ina kiwonsu kan wasu Kwabbai ga Mutanen Makka\"",
