    "hadeeth": "An rawaito daga Nana Aisha -Allah ya yarda da ita- zuwa ga Annabi: \"Annabi SAW bai taba dukan wani abu ba da Hannunsa, ko Wata Mata Ko Baron gida, sai fagen Jahadin daukaka Addinin Allah, sai dai in an keta Hurumin Allah, Sai yayi Hukunci sabida Allah Madaukaki.\"",
