    "explanation": "Cikin wannan Hadisin akwai Bayanin Falalar Azumin wata Rana daya Sabida Allah, yadda Allah zai tserar da shi daga Wuta kuma ya nisanta shi ga barinta Kamar nisan sama da Kasa.",
