    "attribution": "Ibnu Majah ne ya Rawaito shi - Al-Tirmithi Ya Rawaito shi - Abu Daud Ya Rawaito shi - Ahmad ne ya rawaito shi",
  },
  8291: {
    "category_id": 3,
    "category": "ILIMIN AƘIDA",
    "title": "Ubangijinmu zai yaye Maqyagyamarsa, sai kowane Mumini yayi sujada a gare shi Mace da Namiji, sai Waxanda suka kasance suna Sujada a Duniya saboda riya da jiyarwa su tsaya, sai su tafi suyi Sujada sai bayansu ya Sandare baki xaya",
    "hadeeth": "Daga Abu Sa;id -Allah ya yarda da shi- zuwa ga Manzon Allah \"Ubangijinmu zai yaye Maqyagyamarsa, sai kowane Mumini yayi sujada a gare shi Mace da Namiji, sai Waxanda suka kasance suna Sujada a Duniya saboda riya da jiyarwa su tsaya, sai su tafi suyi Sujada sai bayansu ya Sandare baki xaya\"",
