  8292: {
    "category_id": 3,
    "category": "ILIMIN AƘIDA",
    "title": "Lallai Allah Maxaukaki Mai Kunya ne kuma mai Sututwa, yana son Kunya da Suturtawa, saboda haka idan xayanku zai yi Wanka to ya suturta",
    "hadeeth": "Daga Ya'ala -Allah ya yarda da shi- cewa Manzon Allah SAW yaga wani Mutum yana wanka a filin Allah ba tare da Mayafi ba, sai ya hau Mumbari, ya godewa Allah kuma ya yabe shi, sannan ya ce SAW: \"Lallai Allah Maxaukaki Mai Kunya ne kuma mai Sututwa, yana son Kunya da Suturtawa, saboda haka idan xayanku zai yi Wanka to ya suturta\"",
