    "hadeeth": "Daga Abu sa'id Al-Khudri - Allah Ya yarda da shi - daga Annabi - tsira da amincin Allah su tabbata agare shi - ya ce: \"Lallai a cikin aljanna akwai wata bishiya mahayin doki horarre mai sauri zai yi  tafiyar shekara ɗari ba zai iya wuceta ba\".",
