    "category": "FIƘHU DA USULU",
    "title": "Lallai cewa Annabi SAW yayi Al-wala sai ya shafi tsakiyar kansa, da kuma kan Rawaninsa da Huffinsa",
    "hadeeth": "Daga Mugira Bn Shu'aba -Allah ya yarda da shi- Lallai cewa Annabi SAW yayi Al-wala sai ya shafi tsakiyar kansa, da kuma kan Rawaninsa da Huffinsa",
    "explanation": "",
