  },
  8395: {
    "category_id": 4,
    "category": "FIƘHU DA USULU",
    "title": "Lallai cewa Manzon Allah SAW ya sunbanci Wata daga cikin Matansa, sannan ya futa Sallah kuma bai sake Alwala ba",
    "hadeeth": "Daga Ura daga Aisha -Allah ya yarda da ita= zuwa ga manzon Allah \"Lallai cewa Manzon Allah SAW ya sunbanci Wata daga cikin Matansa, sannan ya futa Sallah kuma bai sake Alwala ba\"",
