    "category": "FIƘHU DA USULU",
    "title": "Kada ku tsige Furfura, saboda cewa shi Haske ne ga Musulmi a Ranar Al-qiyama",
    "hadeeth": "Daga Amr Bn Shu'aib, daga Babansa daga Kakansa, -Allah ya yarda da shi- daga Manzon Allah SAW ya ce: \"Kada ku tsige Furfura, saboda cewa shi Haske ne ga Musulmi a Ranar Al-qiyama\"",
