  8934: {
    "category_id": 5,
    "category": "FALALOLI DA LADUBBA",
    "title": "Ya Ku Mutane, duk wanda yasan Wani abu daga cikin kuto ya faxe shi kuma duk wanda bai sani ba to ya ce: Allah ne mafi sani, saboda yana daga cikin Ilimi ya ce a abunda bai sani ba Allah shi ne mafi sani",
    "hadeeth": "Daga Masruq ya ce Mun shiga wajen Ibn Mas'ud -Allah ya yarda da shi- sai ya ce:Ya Ku Mutane, duk wanda yasan Wani abu daga cikin kuto ya faxe shi kuma duk wanda bai sani ba to ya ce: Allah ne mafi sani, saboda yana daga cikin Ilimi ya ce a abunda bai sani ba Allah shi ne mafi sani, Allah SWT ya ce da Annabinsa SAW: \"Kace ban tambayeku lada ba kan abnda nazo muku da shi, kuma ni ban zamanto cikin masu shishigi ba\"",
