  8958: {
    "category_id": 4,
    "category": "FIƘHU DA USULU",
    "title": "Kun yi rantsuwa mai yawa a cikin siyarwa, saboda ciyarwa, to, sai ta fita",
    "hadeeth": "Daga Abu Qatada - Allah ya yarda da shi - cewa ya ji Manzon Allah - tsira da amincin Allah su tabbata a gare shi - yana cewa: \"Kun yi rantsuwa da yawa a cikin siyar, domin an kashe ta, sannan ta cinye.\"",
    "explanation": "",
