    "category_id": 3,
    "category": "ILIMIN AƘIDA",
    "title": "Imani bayamane ne kuma Hikima ma bayamaniya ce",
    "hadeeth": "Daga Abu Hurairah - Allah ya yarda da shi - ya ce: Manzon Allah - tsira da amincin Allah su tabbata a gare shi - ya ce: “Imani daidai ne, kuma hikima mai kyau ce, kuma na sami ran Mafi Rahamah daga Yemen.",
