    "hadeeth": "Daga Abdullahi Bn Al-Shakhir -Allah ya yarda da shi- ya ce: \"Naga Manzon Allah SAW yana Sallah a cikin qirjinsa da wani Ruri Kamar Rurin Dutsen Niqa saboda Kuka SAW\"",
