  10837: {
    "category_id": 7,
    "category": "SIRA DA TARIHI",
    "title": "Lallai cewa Manzon Allah SAW ya zauna a Makkah Shekara goma Al-qur'ani ya na Sauka a gare shi, a Madina kuma Shekara goma",
    "hadeeth": "Daga Aisha da Ibn Abbas -Allah ya yarda da su-: \"Lallai cewa Manzon Allah SAW ya zauna a Makkah Shekara goma Al-qur'ani ya na Sauka a gare shi, a Madina kuma Shekara goma\"",
