  10838: {
    "category_id": 1,
    "category": "ALƘUR'ANI MAI GIRMA DA ILIMANSA",
    "title": "An tambayi Ibn Abbas da Muhammad Bn Al-hanafiyya: shin Annabi SAW ya bar wani abu? sai suka ce: babu abunda ya bari banda abunda yake tsakanin Bangwaye biyu",
    "hadeeth": "Daga Abdul-Aziz Bn Rafi'a ya ce: na shiga ni da Shaddad Bn Ma'aqil, wajen Ibn Abbas -Allah ya yarda da su- sai Shaddad ya ce: An tambayi Ibn Abbas da Muhammad Bn Al-hanafiyya: shin Annabi SAW ya bar wani abu? sai suka ce: babu abunda ya bari banda abunda yake tsakanin Bangwaye biyu",
