  10960: {
    "category_id": 7,
    "category": "SIRA DA TARIHI",
    "title": "Yazid Bin Al-aswad yayi Sallah tare da Manzon Allah SAW ya yi Sallar Asuba, sai mutane sukai ca suna riqe Hannunsa suna shafar fuskokinsu, ya ce: sai na xauke Hannunsa sai na shafi fuskata da shi, sai na, sai naji yafi qanqara Sanyi, kuma yafi Almiski Qanshi",
    "hadeeth": "Daga Yazid Bn Al-aswad -Allah ya yarda da shi- cewa shi yayi Sallah tare da Manzon Allah SAW ya yi Sallar Asuba, sai mutane sukai ca suna riqe Hannunsa suna shafar fuskokinsu, ya ce: sai na xauke Hannunsa sai na shafi fuskata da shi, sai na, sai naji yafi qanqara Sanyi, kuma yafi Almiski Qanshi",
    "explanation": "Na Kasance a wajen Qatada bn mulhan lokacin da ya zo, sai wani Mutum ya wuce a qarshen gida, ya ce sai naganshi a fuskar Qatada, ya ce: Kuma na kasance idan naganshi kai ka ce a fuskarsa Mai ne",
