    "attribution": "Bukhari da Muslim suka Rawaito shi",
  },
  10964: {
    "category_id": 7,
    "category": "SIRA DA TARIHI",
    "title": "Manzon Allah SAW ya ce da ni: \"Matso kusa da ni\" sai na Matso kusa da shi",
    "hadeeth": "Daga Abu Yazid Al-ansari -Allah ya yarda da shi- ya ce: Manzon Allah SAW ya ce da ni: Manzon Allah SAW ya ce da ni: \"Matso kusa da ni\" sai na Matso kusa da shi, sai ya ce: \"Ka shigar da Hannunka ka shafi bayana\" ya ce: sai na shigar da Hannuna cikin Rigarsa, sai na shafi bayansa, sai yatsuna suka tava Hatimin Annabta, sai aka yambayeshi game da Hatimin Annabta sai ya ce: \"Wani Gashi ne a tsakanin Kafaxunsa\"",
    "explanation": ":Manzon Allah SAW ya ce ga Abu Zaid Al-ansari: \"Matso kusa da ni\" sai na Matso kusa da shi, sai ya ce: \"Ka shigar da Hannunka ka shafi bayana\" ya ce: sai na shigar da Hannuna cikin Rigarsa, sai na shafi bayansa, sai yatsuna suka tava Hatimin Annabta, sai aka yambayeshi game da Hatimin Annabta sai ya ce: \"Wani Gashi ne a tsakanin Kafaxunsa\"",
