  10969: {
    "category_id": 4,
    "category": "FIƘHU DA USULU",
    "title": "Manzon Allah SAW ya yi Hajji akan tsohon Siddi, da shinfixa wacce bata wuce Dirhami Huxu ba ko batama kai ba sannan ya ce: \"Ya Ubangiji ina rokonka hajji ba don ganin idon Mutane ba ko don Mutane suji\"",
    "hadeeth": "Daga Anas Bn Malik -Allah ya yarda da shi- ya ce: Manzon Allah SAW ya yi Hajji akan tsohon Siddi, da shinfixa wacce bata wuce Dirhami Huxu ba ko batama kai ba sannan ya ce: \"Ya Ubangiji ina rokonka hajji ba don ganin idon Mutane ba ko don Mutane suji\"",
    "explanation": "Wannan Hadisin yana nuna cewa Manzon Allah SAW yayi hajji akan Taguwa wacce akanta akwai Tsohon Sirdi da Shinfixar da bara wuce Dirhami huxu ba, ko ma qasa da wannan kuxin, sannan ya ce: Wannan Hajjin banyi ta ba don saboda mutane su ganni ko su ji ni, nayi ta ne kaxai dominka, kuma saboda ka yarda da ni",
